{"product_id":"iqos-iluma-prime-i","title":"IQOS Iluma i Prime","description":"\u003cp\u003eIQOS Iluma i Series - Up to three experiences instead of two on each charge, better battery management, pause function.\u003cbr\u003ePhilip Morris International has launched IQOS Iluma i, the latest and most innovative addition to its growing portfolio of smoke-free products, in Kenya. IQOS Iluma disrupted the category by introducing induction-heating technology that heats tobacco from within, to provide a consistent taste experience, no tobacco residue, and no need to clean the device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, IQOS to new heights, with the launch of IQOS Iluma i—the latest innovation in our smoke-free portfolio, offering a range of advanced features for a clean, seamless, and more flexible experience. The new touch screen on the device’s holder allows users to see experience-relevant information quickly and easily.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe new IQOS Iluma i also includes smart features that help prolong the lifespan of the holder’s battery.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBuy IQOS Iluma i Prime Series online at best price in Kenya.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote: All orders for this product will be accepted on partial payment basis only.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"IQOS","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42006272475191,"sku":"Iluma i Prime","price":19999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Iqos-Iluma-i-Prime.webp?v=1764630311","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/iqos-iluma-prime-i","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




